{"id": "long_01", "output": "Okay, so this is just a quick update on the migration project.\n\nWhere we are right now: the database schema is done, and the backfill script is running on staging. It should finish by tonight. The main risk is still the reporting service, because it reads from the old tables directly, and nobody has touched that code in like two years. We're gonna need someone to go through it carefully. I was going to ask Ravi to do it, but actually, Ravi is out next week, so let's ask Mei instead.\n\nOther than that, we're on track for the cutover on the fourteenth. Wait — no, the twelfth? Because the twelfth is a Saturday, and we don't want to do it on a weekend. So yeah, the fourteenth.\n\nLet me know if you have any concerns or if I missed anything. Thanks.", "timings": {"cache_n": 460, "prompt_n": 183, "prompt_ms": 43.114, "prompt_per_token_ms": 0.23559562841530052, "prompt_per_second": 4244.560931483973, "predicted_n": 180, "predicted_ms": 1144.456, "predicted_per_token_ms": 6.3936089385474855, "predicted_per_second": 156.4061877433471, "wall_ms": 1192.621564000092, "finish": "stop"}}
{"id": "long_02", "output": "Hey, so for the dinner party on Saturday, here's what I'm thinking:\n\nWe'll start around seven. People can bring drinks if they want.\n\nFor food, I was thinking we do a taco bar. So we'll need tortillas, ground beef—or actually, let's do chicken, because Anna doesn't eat beef. Cheese, salsa, guacamole, and some limes.\n\nFor dessert, maybe just ice cream—nothing fancy.\n\nOh, and can you ask your brother if he's coming? I need a head count by Thursday.\n\nAlso, we should probably borrow extra chairs from the neighbors since we only have six and there might be ten or twelve people.\n\nWe should probably give the neighbors a heads-up about the noise ahead of time, just so nobody's surprised.\n\nMaybe I'll write them a note tomorrow.\n\nI think that's everything. Let me know if I forgot something.\n\nAnd yeah, it's gonna be fun.", "timings": {"cache_n": 460, "prompt_n": 188, "prompt_ms": 43.357, "prompt_per_token_ms": 0.23062234042553192, "prompt_per_second": 4336.093364393293, "predicted_n": 192, "predicted_ms": 1209.644, "predicted_per_token_ms": 6.333214659685864, "predicted_per_second": 157.8976955203349, "wall_ms": 1258.0683329997555, "finish": "stop"}}
